OL,3,GNEWSASerious car accident shuts M5 in
OL,4,AWorcestershire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M5 motorway is shut northbound in
OL,7,FWorcestershire between junction five
OL,8,Fand junction 4a following a serious
OL,9,Faccident involving two cars.
OL,11,FThe route was closed in both directions
OL,12,Fat about 04:00 GMT on Saturday between
OL,13,Fthe Droitwich and M42 turnoffs,
OL,14,FNational Highways said.
OL,16,FThe southbound route reopened shortly
OL,17,Fafter 06:00, but the northbound
OL,18,Fcarriageway is expected to remain
OL,19,Fclosed throughout the morning for
OL,20,Faccident investigation work.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
